<br>
  I was shocked to hear you say you were leaving us.  I didn't know what to say to you at that moment, that would be a fitting end to your time with us all.  You are the glue that kept Abyss together in my eyes.  The spiritual leader and the voice of reason.  The Wierd Al of our guild chat with your out of this world singing (LOL).  The broodmother for the children of the Abyss.  I will truely miss you.  Even though we only knew each other a short time, I saw what a special person you are.  You impressed me to no ends with your knowledge, charisma, whit, and true leadership abilities everytime you lead us into battle.  What will we do without our Uber Druid?  Please come back from time to time and say hi to us.  We all love and miss you and it's just not the same without you there.  I wish you and your family the best of luck in all that you do from here on out.  Find your happy place in life and never let that kind spirit fade away.  Take care and never forget all of us that love you so much.<br>
<br>
Numadar The'Manaslacker<br>
